Data   : TeslaAccountPageViewModel binds the shared S8 UserStore.teslaUserProfile() (web useTeslaUserProfile) via
         teslaAccountPageSourceOf(); the profile feed drives the page phase. The Refresh action calls
         UserStore.refreshTeslaProfile() (web useRefreshTeslaProfile), whose onSuccess re-collects the profile feed
         (the web hook's invalidateQueries(teslaProfile)); the in-flight flag is surfaced as TeslaAccountPageViewModel.refreshing
         so the Refresh control disables + spins while pending (web disabled={refreshMutation.isPending}). No HTTP in the view.
Adapt  : the page renders BOTH web date faces at the display boundary from raw ISO stamps (TeslaAccountPageModel):
         relativeSynced() reproduces web formatRelative bucket-for-bucket (<60s just-now / <60m / <24h / <7d / else absolute
         medium date) for the sync bar; formatFetchedAt() reproduces web formatDateTime (medium date + short time) for the
         detail-list "Fetched At" row. Relative buckets resolve to the localized freshness.* catalog phrases — zero microcopy.
Strings: all 11 page keys already present in res/values/strings.xml (generated by apps/shared/i18n) — no string-catalog edit
         needed; every literal resolves via stringResource(R.string.translation_teslaAccount_*). lastSynced carries the %1$s
         relative-time token (web {{time}}).
Avatar : no bundled image loader (ADR-002); the image-attributed branch renders the shared Avatar representation with the
         "Profile picture" content description (web <img alt=…>), the no-image branch renders the bordered ImageOff frame
         (web <ImageOff/>). Same content description in either branch so the region is always named.
